artCustomer was founded in 2006, buying from a business online required a l=
eap of faith. The early internet gave rise to a wave of online scams, with =
consumers having little reliable information to distinguish legitimate busi=
nesses from fraudulent ones. Buyers were often left asking:<span class=3D"f=
lex lg:justify-center gap-2 flex-wrap pt-3 lg:pt-4"><span class=3D"tx-bd-3 =
