xl rounded-bl-none">Is it safe to spend my money here?</span></span></p><p =
class=3D"text-main lg:tx-bd-2 tx-sm-bd-1 font-medium max-w-3xl mx-auto text=
-left lg:text-center">SmartCustomer was created to answer those questions. =
We became one of the first platforms to host consumer reviews specifically =
to build trust between buyers and businesses online, giving consumers a pla=
ce to share genuine experiences and a way to make more confident decisions.=
<br><br>Founded in Silicon Valley by Michael Lai, Dr. Rodney Gin, and Jerem=
y Gin, SmartCustomer became one of the first consumer protection platforms =
focused on helping people share experiences, identify trustworthy businesse=
s, and bring greater transparency to online purchasing decisions.<br><br>No=
w, decades later, the problem hasn't gone away. It's gotten harder. Online =
scams are more sophisticated and more widespread than ever, and the landsca=
pe of information consumers rely on to make decisions has grown more comple=
x. Buyers face an overwhelming amount of information from businesses, adver=
tisements, search engines, social media, and AI-generated content.<br><br>T=
hat makes trustworthy reviews more important than ever. Reviews remain one =
of the most powerful tools consumers have, but only when people can trust t=
hem. That means understanding where reviews come from, how they are protect=
ed from manipulation, and whether businesses have influence over what appea=
rs publicly.<br><br>SmartCustomer is committed to maintaining that transpar=
ency and serving as a trusted layer between consumers and businesses online=
, even as that internet continues to evolve.</p></div></div></section><sect=
